<title>FRANCE: France says 1997 soft wheat sowings up 3.4 pct.</title>
<headline>France says 1997 soft wheat sowings up 3.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's farm ministry said on Monday 1997 winter and spring soft wheat sowings may rise by 3.4 percent over the previous year to 4.93 million hectares.</p>
<p>The new estimate puts sowings for spring and winter barley at 1.612 million hectares, up 5.4 percent over 1996.</p>
<p>Durum wheat sowings were expected to fall by 2.4 percent to 263,000 hectares, the ministry said.</p>
</text>
